note uncovered [filter]: every symbol no current step overlaps, largest first, so the owner can audit what a session judged too trivial to map. The owner needs it to audit which symbols a session judged too trivial to map, since coverage is observed rather than enforced (design.md section 5). The filter is a substring of the symbol's name or its file's path. Size is the ordering because a large uncovered symbol is more likely an omission than a small one.

